    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d146">

                <pb facs="0314" n="218" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg218"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr.
                            Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Pelting, China</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-09-23"><hi rendition="#italic">September 23,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Day</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Emperor has been compelled to decree the Empress Dowager coregent. She assumes
                    full power to-day.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
